# Code ownership for review routing.
#
# NOT ACTIVE TODAY. CODEOWNERS requires a public repository or a paid plan
# (Pro / Team / Enterprise). This repo is private on a free personal account,
# so GitHub will neither auto-request reviews from the owners below nor
# enforce them — branch protection returns HTTP 403 here for the same reason.
#
# This file records intended ownership and starts working automatically if the
# repo is made public or the account is upgraded. Until then, treat it as
# documentation: these paths deserve an owner's eyes regardless of tooling.

# Default owner for everything not matched below.
*                       @olpmi

# Database schema and migrations — a bad migration is hard to undo in prod,
# where docker-compose.prod.yml runs `prisma migrate deploy` on startup.
/prisma/                @olpmi

# CI, release, and security workflows — these gate what reaches GHCR.
/.github/               @olpmi

# Production stack and container definitions.
/docker/                @olpmi
/docker-compose.prod.yml @olpmi
